FeatherCFD Solver — Project Overview

Custom 3D incompressible/compressible CFD solver running entirely on GPU via OpenGL compute (fragment) shaders on a 192³ uniform grid. Simulates external aerodynamics over voxelized obstacles (NACA airfoils, cylinders, spheres, CAD meshes) with real-time volumetric raymarching visualization.

---

## Hardware / Runtime

| Item | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **GPU** | NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (4 GB VRAM) |
| **Grid** | 192 × 192 × 192 = ~7M cells |
| **Launch prefix** | `__NV_PRIME_RENDER_OFFLOAD=1 __GLX_VENDOR_LIBRARY_NAME=nvidia` |
| **Data type** | `float16` velocity + density textures (24 MB each); `float32` pressure (28 MB) |
| **Context** | `moderngl.create_standalone_context()` (headless) or GUI mode with Tkinter |

