## Shaders (`shaders/` — 25 files)

### Pipeline Shaders (Incompressible NS)

| Shader | Pass | What it does |
|--------|------|-------------|
| **`forces.frag`** | 1/6 | Inflow BC (X=0, Dirichlet), outflow BC (X=191, convective), no-slip Y/Z walls, SDF obstacle masking, optional force-field injection |
| **`advection.frag`** | 2/6 | Semi-Lagrangian advection with WENO-5 (tensor-product) for interior + trilinear near boundaries, molecular+SGS viscosity via implicit diffusion, velocity clamp modes |
| **`divergence.frag`** | 3/6 | Forward-difference divergence (finite volume), zero inside obstacles, SDF cut-cell correction |
| **`jacobi.frag`** | 4/6 | Fine-grid Jacobi iteration for Poisson solve: 7-point Laplacian with Neumann walls, Dirichlet outflow, SDF-embedded boundary |
| **`rbgs.frag`** | 4/6 | Red-black Gauss-Seidel smoother (same BCs as Jacobi), parity-swapped for parallelism |
| **`coarse_*.frag`** (5 files) | 4/6 | Multigrid coarse-grid operators: Jacobi, RBGS, residual, add correction — all with obstacle masking |
| **`restrict.frag`** | 4/6 | Full-weighting restriction (fine → coarse residual) |
| **`prolongate.frag`** | 4/6 | Trilinear prolongation (coarse → fine correction) |
| **`fine_residual.frag`** | 4/6 | Compute residual r = div - ∇²p on fine grid |
| **`add_correction.frag`** | 4/6 | p += ω·correction with SDF-based under-relaxation |
| **`obstacle_zero.frag`** | 4/6 | Enforce p=0 inside obstacle cells |
| **`projection.frag`** | 5/6 | u ← u - ∇p (Chorin projection), backward-difference gradient, SDF cut-cell BCs |
| **`advection_density.frag`** | 6/6 | BFECC dye advection: semi-Lagrangian with WENO-5 for velocity + trilinear for density, injection slab X=40–64, dt_den = dt_fluid × 3.0 |
| **`copy_tex.frag`** | RK4 | Copy texture (used in RK4 stage save) |
| **`rk4_setup.frag`** | RK4 | u_stage = u_init + coeff·k_prev |
| **`rk4_save_k.frag`** | RK4 | k_i = result - u_stage |
| **`rk4_combine.frag`** | RK4 | u^{n+1} = u^n + (k₁+2k₂+2k₃+k₄)/6 |

### Vertex / Geometry Boilerplate

