## GPU Compute Pipeline (Incompressible, per step)

```
Velocity_A ──► forces.frag ──► Velocity_B     [Add external forces + BCs]
Velocity_B ──► advection.frag ──► Velocity_A  [Semi-Lagrangian WENO-5 advection]
Velocity_A ──► divergence.frag ──► Divergence  [Compute ∇·u]
Divergence ──► _mg_solve() ──► Pressure       [Solve ∇²p = ∇·u via multigrid/DST/FFT]
Velocity_A + Pressure ──► projection.frag ──► Velocity_B  [u ← u - ∇p]
Velocity_B + Density_A ──► advection_density.frag ──► Density_B  [BFECC dye advection]
Swap: Velocity_B→A, Density_B→A  [ping-pong]
```

Pressure solvers (selectable):
- **`jacobi`** (default): 40–120 iterations of fine-grid Jacobi
- **`vcycle`**: 6-level multigrid V-cycle with RBGS smoothers
- **`fft`**: FFT-based (periodic) preconditioner + iterative BC correction loop
- **`dct`**: DST-II exact solve (Dirichlet p=0 at all faces) + RBGS post-smoothing

