## Coordinate Conventions

| Context | Layout | Meaning |
|---------|--------|---------|
| **CPU (numpy)** | `[X, Y, Z]` | X=streamwise (flow), Y=spanwise (vertical), Z=cross-stream (lateral) |
| **GPU (texture)** | `[Z, Y, X]` | OpenGL texture (Z slowest, X fastest) |
| **Disk (`.npy`)** | `[Z, Y, X, 4]` | Raw GPU readback. Channels: 0=X-vel, 1=Y-vel, 2=Z-vel, 3=density/Mach |
| **Transpose** | `np.transpose(data, (2,1,0,...))` | Converts between CPU↔GPU layouts |

All obstacles are Z-centered at `(grid_size-1)/2.0 = 95.5` (corrected from `grid_size/2 = 96.0` which caused 5890 asymmetric cylinder cells).

