## Frame Data Format

Saved `.npy` files (one per saved step) are `[Z, Y, X, 4]` float16 arrays:

| Channel | Incompressible | Compressible |
|---------|---------------|--------------|
| 0 | X-velocity (u) | X-velocity (u) |
| 1 | Y-velocity (v) | Y-velocity (v) |
| 2 | Z-velocity (w) | Z-velocity (w) |
| 3 | Dye density ρ | Mach number |

Injection slab: X=40–64, Y=50–140, Z=20–170 (upstream of NACA LE at X≈95.5).

